@startuml
!include _style.puml
title Shipment State: ShippingStatus Is Independently Managed
hide empty description
[*] --> PENDING : entity default / @PrePersist\n[not normally saved by tracking API]
[*] --> SHIPPED : assignTrackingNumber() creates shipment\n[owned PREPARING order; paid group; valid tracking]
PENDING --> SHIPPED : assignTrackingNumber()\nor Admin updateShippingStatus("SHIPPED")
SHIPPED --> DELIVERED : Admin updateShippingStatus("DELIVERED")\n/ deliveredAt=now
DELIVERED --> SHIPPED : Admin updateShippingStatus("SHIPPED")
SHIPPED --> PENDING : Admin updateShippingStatus("PENDING")
DELIVERED --> PENDING : Admin updateShippingStatus("PENDING")
PENDING --> DELIVERED : Admin updateShippingStatus("DELIVERED")\n/ deliveredAt=now
PENDING --> PENDING : Admin updateShippingStatus("PENDING")
SHIPPED --> SHIPPED : Admin updateShippingStatus("SHIPPED")
DELIVERED --> DELIVERED : Admin updateShippingStatus("DELIVERED")\n/ replace deliveredAt

note bottom of PENDING
Assign tracking sets courierName, trackingNumber,
Shipment.shippingStatus=SHIPPED and shippedAt;
it also sets Order=SHIPPED and Order.shippedAt.
Admin updates accept any valid ShippingStatus without
checking the previous state or changing Order status.
SHIPPED adds shippedAt only if missing.
Changing to PENDING/SHIPPED does not clear deliveredAt.
end note
note left of DELIVERED
Customer confirmation and auto-confirm change Order
to COMPLETED only; Shipment can remain SHIPPED.
No courier callback or automatic tracking integration exists.
end note
